  ("What information do you need to quote a packing machine?", "Five things: (1) the product and its form — powder, granule, liquid or solid; (2) weight or volume per pack; (3) required speed in packs per minute or per day; (4) pack type and size — sachet, stick, pillow bag, gusset bag, premade zipper pouch, bottle; and (5) your voltage (e.g. 220 V 1-phase or 380/415/440 V 3-phase, 50/60 Hz). Photos of a sample pack help a lot."),
